<title>USA: Chesapeake Energy declines comment on stock.</title>
<headline>Chesapeake Energy declines comment on stock.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chesapeake Energy Corp on Monday declined to comment on its stock activity.</p>
<p>By early afternoon, Chesapeake's stock had dropped 3-3/8 to 19-5/8 and was one of the most active issues on the New York Stock Exchange, with about 2.6 million shares changing hands.</p>
<p>The Oklahoma City-based company produces oil and natural gas, and provides oilfield services.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
